# Text files are checked out with LF everywhere, including on Windows where core.autocrlf
# would otherwise turn them into CRLF. Prettier and rustfmt expect LF, so without this
# `npm run format` fails on every Windows checkout (the CI runner and local clones alike).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files Windows itself runs keep CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.wav binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
